  - Zostera marina
  - Zostera noltei
  - remote sensing
  - Sentinel-2
  - Google Earth Engine
  - machine learning
  - random forest
  - support vector machine
  - gradient boosting
  - Black Sea
  - habitat mapping
  - Case-2 waters
